[00:00.39]Ha…
[00:01.33]Plug in.
[00:04.65]Retry.
[00:05.82]♫
[00:09.29]♫
[00:15.78]I don’t speak heart
[00:16.66]I speak device
[00:17.78]Voltage, signal, wrong advice
[00:19.51]I don’t read eyes
[00:20.22]I read the screen
[00:21.20]If something breaks
[00:21.95]It turns green
[00:23.71]Your name shows up
[00:24.93]Like a fault
[00:26.48]I don’t know why
[00:27.62]But I won’t halt
[00:31.03]Run clean — don’t break code
[00:33.99]Keep your signal under control
[00:37.50]Stay online — don’t decline
[00:41.14]Status: fine — you’re fine — you’re fine
[00:44.21]If love is a program
[00:45.78]Mine won’t compile
[00:47.51]It freezes my logic
[00:49.19]But I like the file
[00:50.96]I don’t say miss you
[00:52.93]I check the link
[00:54.62]If you disconnect
[00:56.07]I stop. I blink.
[00:58.24]♫
[01:02.87]Connection stable, nothing to reset
[01:04.80]Signal in range, no offset
[01:06.74]You call it feeling, I call it noise
[01:08.29]System runs better when you limit the choice
[01:10.10]Keep it aligned, keep it contained
[01:11.79]If it feels wrong, it’s just misframed
[01:13.61]Everything functions when you do it right
[01:17.68]I map your voice
[01:18.59]In binary
[01:21.35]You feel like noise
[01:22.33]But safely
[01:24.76]I don’t know why
[01:25.98]I need you near
[01:28.51]But errors spike
[01:29.21]When you’re not here
[01:32.06]Run clean — don’t break code
[01:34.82]Keep your signal under control
[01:38.10]Stay online — don’t decline
[01:41.70]Status: fine — you’re fine — you’re fine
[01:45.30]If love is a circuit
[01:46.42]I don’t know the shape
[01:48.25]I solder too close
[01:49.89]And burn the tape
[01:52.14]I don’t say care
[01:53.48]I say don’t go
[01:56.06]If you crash
[01:59.51]I crash slow
[02:00.61]♫
[02:07.31]Maintain the frame, don’t cross the line
[02:09.73]Every anomaly gets redefined
[02:11.41]You feel too much? Then optimize
[02:13.15]Trim the signal, stabilize
[02:15.31]♫
[02:18.06]Wrong input
[02:19.94]Right response
[02:22.02]I don’t know
[02:23.28]Where feelings belong
[02:25.41]If this is love
[02:26.68]I misread the sign
[02:28.40]But I’ll stay connected
[02:30.16]Till the end of the line
[02:33.93]♫
[02:35.63]Error acknowledged.
[02:38.09]Do not unplug.
[02:39.28]♫
